  <Text>Not all accident and incident reports are completed nor submitted on a timely basis.

The organization takes action on the identified opportunities to resolve environmental safety issues. (See also EC.04.01.03, EP 2)
2.	The organization evaluates changes to determine if they resolved environmental safety issues.
